# MrScraper MCP Server

An MCP server exposing the seven MrScraper services through hosted HTTP or local stdio.

## Overview

Seven services share the same descriptions, parameter meanings, and defaults across the CLI, SDKs, and integrations. Names, types, authentication, and code examples follow each surface's conventions. See the API Reference.

